---
import Navbar from "../../../components/Navbar.astro";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>博客 — Linxira OS</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/favicon.svg">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Noto Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0E1417; color: #e5e7eb; min-height: 100vh; }
    .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
    .subtitle { color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 3rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .post-card { display: block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.8), rgba(14,20,23,0.9)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 16px; padding: 2rem; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .post-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(32,184,176,0.4); }
    .post-date { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .post-title { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .post-desc { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .post-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.15); color: #20B8B0; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 0.75rem; }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 3rem 2rem; color: #475569; font-size: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <Navbar lang="zh" active="blog" />

  <div class="container">
    <h1>博客</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">项目公告、版本更新和技术文章</p>

    <a href="/zh/blog/introducing-linxira-os/" class="post-card">
      <div class="post-date">2026-06-27</div>
      <div class="post-title">Linxira OS 介绍</div>
      <div class="post-desc">Linxira OS 是什么，为谁而建，为什么要做这个项目。设计理念、技术架构和目标用户。</div>
      <span class="post-tag">公告</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <footer><p>Linxira OS 直接基于 Arch Linux 构建，是与 Arch Linux 无隶属关系且未经其官方认可的独立项目。</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
